
# Add the second row product to the cart and verify it matches


// Add Product To The Cart
* Find Element Where "secondRowProductCss" then click
* Verify Windows Count Equals To "expectedWindowCount"
* Assertion|Verify Redirection To Product Page
* Switch To "productWindowIndex" Window
* Store Element Text "productTitleXpath" as "productNameStoreKey"
* Find Element Where "addToCartButtonCss" then click
* Verify Element "cartPopupCss"
* Move to "defaultMouseX" , "defaultMouseY" then click
* Assertion|Verify Product Added To Cart

// Open Cart
* Find Element Where "shoppingCartId" then click
// Control The Product Inside The Cart
* Assertion|Verify Product Visible In Cart
* Verify Element "cartProductNameCss"
* Verify Element "cartProductVariantCss"
* Expect "cartProductNameCss" to contain "productNameStoreKey"